<section
  id="studio-overlay"
  class="h-svh w-full overflow-y-scroll fixed z-50 top-0 right-0 backdrop-blur-sm backdrop-brightness-75 hidden items-end justify-end"
  role="dialog"
  aria-modal="true"
  aria-labelledby="studio-title"
>
  <div class="w-full md:max-w-[40svw] p-4 h-full bg-black/40">
    <button
      id="studio-close"
      type="button"
      class="place-self-end block mb-16 cursor-pointer bg-transparent border-none p-0 text-inherit hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity"
      aria-label="Close studio information"
    >
      ( Close )
    </button>

    <div class="divide-y divide-white/20 mb-16">
      <h2 id="studio-title" class="mb-4 pb-4 text-base">
        Our Studio
      </h2>
      <p class="text-muted">
        We believe great architecture is not defined by how much it contains,
        but by how thoughtfully each element is considered. Our work explores
        the relationship between space, light, material, proportion, and the
        people who inhabit it.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-16">
      <h2 class="mb-4 pb-4 text-base border-b border-b-white/20">
        Our Principles
      </h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div>
          <h3 class="mb-2">Clarity</h3>
          <p class="text-muted">
            Every decision has a purpose. We seek architectural solutions that
            are clear in both idea and execution.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="mb-2">Materiality</h3>
          <p class="text-muted">
            Materials are selected for how they age, feel, and contribute to the
            character of a space.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="mb-2">Light</h3>
          <p class="text-muted">
            Natural light is treated as an architectural material, shaping
            atmosphere, movement, and experience throughout the day.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="mb-2">Restraint</h3>
          <p class="text-muted">
            We believe restraint creates room for what matters. Rather than
            adding for effect, we refine until essential remains.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="">
      <a href="mailto:kldesignstudio@gmail.com" class="block hover:underline">
        E: kldesignstudio@gmail.com
      </a>
      <a href="tel:+639123456789" class="block hover:underline">
        P: +63 9123456789
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
